# Copy to keystore.properties (gitignored) to build a signed release.
#
# The keystore itself lives OUTSIDE the repo on purpose — it is the identity of
# the app. If it is lost, no future build can update an installed copy, and a
# Play listing signed with it can never be updated again. Back up both this
# file and the .jks somewhere durable.
storeFile=/home/YOU/.keystores/lekh-release.jks
storePassword=...
keyAlias=lekh
keyPassword=...
